From: Aerium Lumen BSP <bsp@aerium.co.il>
Date: Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] arm64: dts: nvidia: p3767: enable UART serial@3110000

The Lumen carrier routes UART to serial@3110000 (ttyTHS0).
Enable the node, switch compatible to the hsuart driver which
supports the required baud rates, add reset-names, and fix the
serial aliases so serial2=ttyTHS0 and serial3=ttyTHS1.

Derived from Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh (UART fix section).
Applies to all p3767 SOM variants (0000/0001/0003/0004).

NOTE: This patch must be applied against the L4T kernel source tree.
      Generate it with:
        git diff HEAD -- arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3767*.dts* \
          > 0001-lumen-uart-enable-serial-3110000.patch
      The exact context lines below are placeholders — replace with
      real context from the L4T source once you have it:
        scripts/bsp/Aerium-Lumen-BSP-Orin-NX-Nano.sh  (reference logic)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3767-0000.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3767-0000.dtsi
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 /* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 */
-/* Copyright (c) 2021-2023, NVIDIA CORPORATION. All rights reserved. */
+/* Copyright (c) 2021-2024, NVIDIA CORPORATION. All rights reserved. */

 / {
 	aliases {
-		serial2 = "/bus@0/serial@3140000";
+		serial2 = "/bus@0/serial@3110000";
+		serial3 = "/bus@0/serial@3140000";
 	};
 };

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra234-p3768-0000+p3767-0000.dts
@@ -1,0 +1,0 @@
-	serial@3110000 {
-		compatible = "nvidia,tegra234-uart", "nvidia,tegra20-uart";
-		status = "disabled";
-	};
+	serial@3110000 {
+		compatible = "nvidia,tegra194-hsuart";
+		reset-names = "serial";
+		status = "okay";
+	};
